{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":1300,"row":{"en":"The toddler continued to look at the plants. Then, he noticed a cable running along the floor.","wo":"Perantal bi wéy di xool gàñcax yi. Ci noonu mu gis fiil bu jaar ci suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPérantal bi weuy di khol gancakh yi. Thi nonou mou guiss fiil bou diar thi souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1301,"row":{"en":"This can lead to better outcomes for patients, as they are more likely to receive the help that they need.","wo":"Loolu mën na yokk tanug malaad bi, ndax ci la ñuy gëna am wërsëgu am paj mi ñu soxla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou meun na yokk tanou malaad bi ndakh si la niouy geuna ame weurseugue ame padj mi niou sokhla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1302,"row":{"en":"These organs are then sold to wealthy people who can afford to pay for them.","wo":"Su noppee ñu jël cër yooyu, jaay leen boroom alal yi leen mëna jënd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou noppé gnou dieul thieur yoyou, diay léne borom alal yi léne meuna dieundé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1303,"row":{"en":"I have become a recluse, afraid to venture out into the world lest I come face to face with my worst nightmare.","wo":"Nekk naa nit ku tëju, ragal a wane sama bopp ndax dama ragal a jàkkarloo jëhran ak lima gëna ragal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNek na nitt kou teudjou ragal a wané sama bopp ndakh dama ragal a diakarlo djieuran ak lima geuna ragal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1304,"row":{"en":"These elements are essential to the poem's overall effect, and they can be difficult to reproduce in another language.","wo":"Mbir yooyu dañu am solo ndax dañu bokk ci liy neexal taalif, te boole mbir yooyu yépp yóbbu leen ci weneen làkk lu jafe la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbire yoyou daniou ame solo ndakh daniou bok thi liy neukhal taalife té boolé mbire yoyou yeup yobou léne thi wénéne lak lou diafé la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1305,"row":{"en":"The debate of man vs. machine is a long-standing one, with no easy answer.","wo":"Werante yàgg na am ci xarañte diggante nit ak masin, waaye tontu li musul yomb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWeranté yague na ame thi kharanté diguenté nite ak machine, wayé tontou li mussoul yombe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1306,"row":{"en":"Female, above average height, red hair in tidy bunches, short skirt;","wo":"Jigéen ju njool, am kawar gu xonk mu takk ci chignon, sol jupe bu gàtt;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiguéne djou ndiol ame kawar gou khonk mou tak thi chignon sol jupe bou gate\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1307,"row":{"en":"The average pit bull is good-natured, amusing, and capable of extreme affection for the members of its pack.","wo":"Li gëna bari ci pit bull yi dañu neex deret te mën nañu kaf, séq jàmm ak ñi mu nekkal ñépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi geuna bari si pit bull yi daniou nekh deret té meun nagnou kaf sék diam ak gni mou nekal nieupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1308,"row":{"en":"We had been working hard all season, and it was finally time to reap the rewards.","wo":"Sesoŋ bi yépp danu koy liggéey noppalu wunu, leegi jotna nu góob linu liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSeson bi yeup daniou koy liguey noppalou wouniou legui diotna niou goob liniou liguey.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1309,"row":{"en":"Young Man: I get what you're saying. But you have to be careful.","wo":"Ku ndaw ki: Xam naa li nga wax. Waaye danga wara moytu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou ndaw ki: Khame naa li nga wakh. Wayé danga wara moytou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1310,"row":{"en":"It was a bright and sunny day in the small village of Locksmiths, and the festival of locks was in full swing.","wo":"Bis la bu leer, am naaj ci village u defarkati loke yi, te màggalug loke gaa ngi doon jolli bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss la bou leer am naadj si village u defarkati loké yi té maggalou loké ga ngui done djolli bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1311,"row":{"en":"No, you can't, Mommy said. Cables can be dangerous.They can give you a shock.","wo":"Yaay ji niko, déedet, fiil yi wóoru ñu, mën nañu la maas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji niko dédéte fiil yi worou gnou meune nagnou la mass\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1312,"row":{"en":"What are you doing out here all alone? he asked.","wo":"Mu laaj ko, lan nga def fii yaw kese?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou ladj ko lane nga def fi yaw kessé ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1313,"row":{"en":"It was a beautiful day for a picnic, so my family and I decided to go to the park.","wo":"Benn bis la woon bu neex ci def piknik, ci noonu man ak sama waa kër ni dañu dem ci park bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss la wone bou nekh thi def piknik, thi nonou mane ak sama wa keur nioniou daniou dem thi parc bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1314,"row":{"en":"Third, it can create unnecessary conflict and division.","wo":"Ñatteel ba mooy mën na tax nga jàppante ak moom te jaru ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiateel ba moy meun na takh nga diapanté ak mom té diarouko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1315,"row":{"en":"It's majesty brought a deep sense of rarely felt patriotic pride swelling into my awareness.","wo":"Buur bu mag dafa yee ci man yëg-yëgu bëgg sa réew ak fonk sa bopp bu bariwul luñu koy gis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBour bou mag dafa yé ci mane yeug yeugou beug sa rew ak fonk sa bopp bou bariwoul lougnou koy guiss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1316,"row":{"en":"But even though the universe may end, the story of life will continue.","wo":"Waaye, doonte univers bi mën na jeex, jaar-jaaru dundu gi dafay wéy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé, donté univers bi meun na diekh, diar diarou doundou gui dafay way.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1317,"row":{"en":"They are immediately befriended by Candy, an old ranch hand who is missing an arm.","wo":"Ñu daal di fay teeli xaritoo ak Candy, kenn ku ñàkk benn loxoom, yàgg a liggéey ci tool bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou daldi fay téli kharito ak Candy kene kou niak bene lokhoom yague a liguey ci tool bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1318,"row":{"en":"In the early 1900s, Americans were introduced to the drug morphine through the use of over-the-counter cough syrups.","wo":"Ci ndoortey ati 1900, ci la waa Amerique xam drog bii tuddu morphine mu nekkoon ci siro sëqët buñ daan jaay ku nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi ndortéy ati 1900, thi la wa amerique kham drogue bii toudou morphine mou nekone thi siro seuket bougn dane diay kou nek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1319,"row":{"en":"She believed that her art was important, and she wanted to share it with the world.","wo":"Dafa gëmoon ni art dafa am solo, mu bëggoon ko séddoo ak àdduna bi yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa geumon ni art dafa am solo, mou beugone ko sedoo ak addouna bi yeupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1320,"row":{"en":"must","wo":"lu toll ci ci","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou toll thi si\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1321,"row":{"en":"Bella's anger was healthy because it was a response to the injustice she had faced.","wo":"Merug Bella lu jaaduwoon la ndax dafa doon fësal lu jaaduwul li ñu doon teg ci kawam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeurou Bella lou diadouwone la ndakh dafa done feussal lou diadoul li gnou done teugg thi kawam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1322,"row":{"en":"I've been reading magazines ever since, and I still love the way they can open my mind to new ideas.","wo":"Booba ba leegi maa lire magazine, te ba leegi maa ngi bëgg ni ñuy may joxe gis-gis bu bees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBobaa ba légui ma lire magazine té ba légui mangui beug ni gnouy may diokhé guiss-guiss bou bess.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1323,"row":{"en":"In some cases, corticosteroids may be used to reduce inflammation.","wo":"Su demee noonu, mënu nañu jëfandikoo corticosteroid ngir wàññi inflamasioŋ bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou démé nonou, meunou gnou dieufandiko corticosteroid nguir wagnii inflammation bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1324,"row":{"en":"Child: Can I look through it?","wo":"Xale bi: Ndax mën naa ci xool?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bi: Ndakh meun naa thi khol ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1325,"row":{"en":"Therefore, the concentration of ions increases, resulting in increased conductivity.","wo":"Kon concentration ion yi dañuy gëna yokk ba mujji yokk yoonale bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKon concentration ion yi daniouy geuna yok ba moudji yokk yoonalé bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1326,"row":{"en":"However, their main emphasis was to encourage trade throughout a particular area.","wo":"Waaye li gënoon nekk seen mébet mooy ñaax nit ñi ci njaay ci benn barab bu ñu tànn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé li geunone nekk seen mébet moy gnakh nitt gni si ndiaay si bene barab bou gnou tane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1327,"row":{"en":"It is to be a land where everyone has a chance to succeed, regardless of their background or circumstances.","wo":"Dafa wara nekk réew mu ku nekk am yaakaaru tekki, doonte fi ñu bawoo ak liñu dundu mettina.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa wara nek rew mou kou nek ame yakarou tekki, donté fi gnou bawoo ak lignou doundou metina.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1328,"row":{"en":"The anonymous taster was so surprised at the unusual but fantastic taste that he dropped the flower vase.","wo":"Ki doon mos te kenn xamul turam dafa yéemu ci neexaayu cafka gi amul fenn, ba daa mujjee daaneel vase u flër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKii done mos té kene khamoul tourame dafa yeumou thi nekhayou cafka gui amoul fene, ba daa moudié danél vase u fleur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1329,"row":{"en":"Let the music fill your soul and your body will move of its own accord.","wo":"Bàyyil music bi dugg sa ruuh, sa yaram mooy demal boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBayile music bi dougg sa rouh, sa yaram moy demal boppam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1330,"row":{"en":"The gardener's journey began with a simple drive to the local nursery.","wo":"Tukkib jardinier baa ngi tàmbali ci dawal gu yómb dem ci pepiñeeru dëkk bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nToukki bi jardinier ba moungui tambali si dawal gou yomb dem si pepiniérou deuk bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1331,"row":{"en":"I sat down next to a girl named Sarah.","wo":"Ma toog ci wetu benn xale bu jigéen bu tuddu Sarah.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa togue ci wetou bene khalé bou djiguéne bou toudou Sarah.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1332,"row":{"en":"A solo traveler was found safe after spending two nights lost in the Swiss Alps.","wo":"Daa amoon ku réeroon ci Alpes yu Swiss, mu toog ñaari guddi kenn gisu ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaa amone kou rérone thi alpes you swiss, mou togue gnari goudi kene guissouko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1333,"row":{"en":"I kissed her on the forehead and then I left.","wo":"Ci laa ko fóon ci jë ba noppi ma dem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSi la ko fone si die ba nopi ma dem\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1334,"row":{"en":"The driver of the first car was killed instantly, and the driver of the second car was seriously injured.","wo":"Benn dawalkat bi dafa faatu ci saasi, beneen damalkat bi am gaañ-gaañu yu metti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn dawalkat bi dafa faatou thi sassi, beneen dawalkat bi am gagne-gagne you metti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1335,"row":{"en":"Light rum is typically made from molasses and has a light, sweet flavor.","wo":"Melaas lañu faral di defaree rhum bu woyof bi te cafkaam daa saf suukër, te foorul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMelaas lagnou faral di defaré rhum bou woyof bi te cafkaam da saf soukeur té foorul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1336,"row":{"en":"I smiled back and said, Hi, I'm Vera.","wo":"Ma muuñ man itam niko, Nanga def, Man maay Vera.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa mougne mane itame niko nanga def mane maye Vera\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1337,"row":{"en":"They accuse her of being a traitor, and they take her to a secret prison.","wo":"Ñu jiiñ ko ni warkat la, ñu jàpp ko tëj ko fu kenn xamul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou djiigne ko ni warkate la, gnou diap ko teudj ko fou kene khamoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1338,"row":{"en":"She has learned that she is strong and independent, and she is no longer afraid to face whatever challenges come her way.","wo":"Leegi xamna ni mënal na bopp te dëgër, te leegi ragalatul jàmmarloo ak jafe-jafe yu mu mëna doon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui khamna ni meunal na bopp té deugeur, té legui ragalatoul diamarlo ak diafé-diafé you mou meuna done.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1339,"row":{"en":"The Buddha taught that the way to end suffering is to let go of our attachments.","wo":"Buddha daf nu jàngal ni sunu bañee amati lunu metti danu wara bàyyi bëgg àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBouddha daf gnou diangal ni souniou bagné amati lougnou méti daniou wara bayi beug addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1340,"row":{"en":"White, ivory, natural red, pink, orange, brown, yellow, green, blue, purple, black, gray, silver, gold, copper, multicolored.","wo":"Weex, ivoire, xonk buñ raxul, rose, orange, maroŋ, mboq, wert, baxa, violet, ñuul, dóomu-taal, xaalis, wurus, përëm, bari-melo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWeukh, ivoire, honkh bougn rakhoul, rose, orange, maron, mbokh, wert, bakha, violet, gnoull, domou-tall, khaliss, wourouss, preum, bari-mélo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1341,"row":{"en":"It's just as important as light, and it has its own beauty.","wo":"Leer ak lëndëm yépp am njariñ, dolli ci ni lëndëm daa yor taaru boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLeer ak leundeum yeup ame ndiarigne dolli thi ni leundeum da yorr taarou boppame\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1342,"row":{"en":"Darkness helps us to rest and sleep.","wo":"Lëndëm moo nuy jàppale nu noppalu ak nelaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLeundeum mo gnou diapalé gnou noppalou ak nelaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1343,"row":{"en":"Only a genius could invent a suitcase with a whistle attached!","wo":"Kàngam rek a mëna defar valise ba noppi takkaale ci mbiip!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKangam rk a meuna defar valise ba noppi takalé si mbiip bi !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1344,"row":{"en":"The total amount of heat that a refrigerator or freezer can remove from its contents is called the cooling capacity.","wo":"Tolluwaayu tàngoor wi frigo bi wala congelatër bi mëna dindi ci liñu ci denc lañuy woowe kàttanu seddal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTollouwayou tangor wi frigo bi wala congelateur bi meuna dindi ci lignou ci denc lagnouy wowé kattanou seddal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1345,"row":{"en":"They can also cause power outages and flooding.","wo":"Mën nañu indi kupiiru kuuraŋ ak mbënd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou indi coupure courant ak mbeund.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1346,"row":{"en":"This can lead to unnecessary anxiety and stress, as well as unnecessary medical procedures, such as biopsies.","wo":"Loolu mën na jural nit ki tiitaange ak njàqare ku amul njariñ wala ñu koy defal paj mu ko dul amal njariñ, lu melni ay biopsie.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou meun na dioural nitt ki titaangé ak ndiakhare kou amoul ndiarigne wala gnou koy defal patch mou ko doul amal ndiarigne, lou melni ay biopsi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1347,"row":{"en":"If you recall, we were told in August that the economy was slowing and the recovery, which was slow, was losing steam.","wo":"Su gen fattelikoo newpnnañu ci weeru ut bi ni koom bi mungi waññeku te yokkaat bi, nga xamni defa yiixon, mungi don ñakk likoy doolel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou gen fatélikou néwpena gnou ci wérou out bi ni kom bi moungui wagnékou té yokate bi nga khamni défa yiikhone moungui done gnak likoy dolél.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1348,"row":{"en":"However, when the delivery guy showed up, he was not carrying a pizza.","wo":"Waaye ki koy indi bimu yegsee, limu indi bokkul ak pizza.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé kii koy indi bimou yégssé limou indi bokoul ak pizza\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1349,"row":{"en":"The satisfaction of a perfect touch was something that Aida had never experienced before.","wo":"Laal bu jaar yoon bi ñu laal Aida, jural nako bànneex bumu musul dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLal bou diar yone bi gnou lal Aida dioural nako baneh boumou meusseul doundou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1350,"row":{"en":"It was a truly memorable day, and one that I will never forget.","wo":"Bis la bu ñépp di fàttaliku, kenn duko fàtte mukk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss la bou gneup di fattalikou, ken douko faté mouk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1351,"row":{"en":"There are still many people in the world who are denied their freedom, simply because of their race, their gender, or their religion.","wo":"Ba leegi ci àdduna bi, amna nit ñu bari ñuñ dul nangu ñu moom seen bopp, te tegu ñu ko ludul ci xeet wiñ bokk, li ñu nekk jigéen, wala seen diine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa légui ci addouna bi amna nitt gnou bari gniougn doul nangou gnou mom sén bopp té tégg gnouko loudoul thi khéét wign bokk, li gnou nek djiguéne wala sén diné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1352,"row":{"en":"Acid rain can damage trees by making their leaves more acidic.","wo":"Tawu asid mën na yàq garab yi, gëna asidloo seeni xob.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTawou asid meun na yak garab yi, geuna asidloo seeni khobé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1353,"row":{"en":"In fact, most scientists believe that sickness is caused by natural factors, such as bacteria and viruses.","wo":"Waaye boroom xam-xam yi ci wàllu science dañu gëm ni doomi jàngoro yu melni bakteri wala virus ñoo waral feebar yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé borom kham kham yi si walou science daniou geum ni domi diangoro you melni bacterie wala virus gno waral feebar yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1354,"row":{"en":"The river was also a popular spot for humans to swim, fish, and relax.","wo":"Dex la woon itam gu ñu bari xamoon, ñu daan fa dem di féey, napp ak féexlu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDékh la wone itame gu gnou bari khamone, gnou dane fa dem di féy, nap ak fékhlou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1355,"row":{"en":"Such is the case with the story I am about to tell you, a tale of supernatural forces and the strange events that unfolded when they were unleashed upon the world.","wo":"Mooy xew-xew bii ma leen di waaja nettali, muy ay kéemtaan yu mag ak mbir yu doywaar, yu tasaaroo ci kaw bi ñu leen wàccee ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy hew hew bii ma len di wadja netali mouy ay kéemtaane you mag ak mbir you doywaar you tassaaro si kaw bi gnou len wathie si aduna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1356,"row":{"en":"They are a means of expression, a way to create something beautiful and delicious.","wo":"Bu nekk ci ñoom day wax, anam wu ñuy jaar ba defar lu rafet te neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou nek thi gnom day wakh anam wou gnouy diar ba defar lou rafet té nekh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1357,"row":{"en":"My first day of school was a day I will never forget.","wo":"Duma musa fàtte bis bi may njëkka dem ekol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDouma moussa faté biss bi may ndieuka dem école.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1358,"row":{"en":"You're a bunch of entitled brats, and I'm sick of it.","wo":"Xale yu xamadi ngeen, loolu mooma soof ci yeen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé you khamadi ngéne lolou moma soof thi yéne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1359,"row":{"en":"I am fine","wo":"Maa ngi ci jàmm","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui si diam rek\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1360,"row":{"en":"Adorable robots, hug-transmitting mugs, and mood-changing clothing?","wo":"Ay robo yu neex nit ñi, ay kaas yuy joxe ay raay, ay colin yuy soppi xar kanam gi?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy robo you nékh nitt gni ay kaas youy diokhé ay raay ay colin youy sopi khar kanam gui ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1361,"row":{"en":"I mean, he's the only person I know who can drink coffee and still fall asleep in class.","wo":"Maanaam ci moom rek laa gis kuy naan kafe ba noppi di nelaw klaas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nManame thi mom rek la guiss kouy nane café ba nopi di nelaw classe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1362,"row":{"en":"That's okay. You don't have to be ready right away. Just take your time and heal.","wo":"Kon baaxna, jarul ngay yàkkamti. Xaaral ba sa xol wér bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKon bakhna diaroul ngay yakamti kharal ba sa khol wér bou bakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1363,"row":{"en":"Finally, don't be afraid to experiment with different styles.","wo":"Fi may jeexalee mooy, bul ragala sol yeneen xeetu yéere ngir soppi solin.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFimaay diekhale moy boul ragal sol yenen khettou yéré nguir sopi soline.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1364,"row":{"en":"In the meantime, I tried to keep the rash clean and dry.","wo":"Balaa boobu, maa ngi raxas tëndandiir yi bàyyi leen ñu waw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBala bobou mangui rakhass teundandiir yi bayi len gnou waw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1365,"row":{"en":"Some of the most popular hippie bands included the Grateful Dead, Jefferson Airplane, and the Doors.","wo":"Ñenn ci orkestar yi gënoon siiw ci wàllu hippie ñooy Grateful Dead, Jefferson Airplane, ak Doors yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnén ci orkestar yi geunone siw thi wallou hippie gnoy Grateful Dead, Jefferson Airplane ak Doors yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1366,"row":{"en":"Another way to achieve internal consistency is to be honest with ourselves about our strengths and weaknesses.","wo":"Meneen mbir muy miñu mëna def ngir tegu ci yoon wu baax wi miiy nu baña nax sunu bopp ci linu mën ak linu desee mën.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMenein mbir mouy mignou meuna def nguir teugueu thi yone wou bakh wi miiy niou bagna nakh souniou bopp thi linou meun ak linou dessé meun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1367,"row":{"en":"Doctor: I see. Well, it sounds like you're having a case of gastritis.","wo":"Doktër bi: Dëgg la, daa melni danga am gastritis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDocteur bi deug la da melni danga ame gastrite.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1368,"row":{"en":"Sudan is a country in northeastern Africa.","wo":"Sudan dëkk la bu nekk ci nord-est Afrique.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoudan deuk leu bou nekk thi nord-est afrique.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1369,"row":{"en":"We are simply beings who are experiencing the world through our senses.","wo":"Nun ay mbindéef lanu yu nekk ci àdduna, am sunuy yëg-yëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNoun ay mbindéff lagnou you nek si addouna, ame souniouy yeug yeug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1370,"row":{"en":"Aditi: I've always wanted a cat, but I'm allergic.","wo":"Aditi: Dama yàgg a bëgga muus, waaye sama yaram nanguwu ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAditi: Dama yague beuga mouss wayé sama yaram nangouwouko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1371,"row":{"en":"One of the most important things to remember when trying to let go of our attachments is that we are not our possessions.","wo":"Menn mbir mu gëna jara bàyyi xel sooy jéema teggi sunu bakkan ci sunuy moomeel mooy nu xamni dunu sunu moomeel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMenn mbir mou gueuna diara bayyi khel sooy djéema tegui souniou bakane thi souniouy moomeel mooy niou khamni douniou souniou moomeel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1372,"row":{"en":"If you wanna complain, complain that the government makes you get permission to stop being married.","wo":"Soo bëgge ñaxtu, ñaxtul nguur gi may la nga bayi sëy","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo beugué niakhtou niakhtoul ngour gui mayla nga bayi seuy rek\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"trun